Minimum Requirements
Relevant tertiary qualification;
6-9 years editorial experience in an established newsroom;
Newsroom management experience would be preferential;
Experience in a digital environment would be an added advantage;
Thorough working knowledge of news production, media ethics and the media environment.
Duties & Responsibilities
Edit submitted news copy to ensure it meets all quality benchmarks, is free of errors and meets the standards of the Press Code, all relevant legislation and News24’s style guide;
Rewrite intros and angles of news stories to make them more appealing for our readers;
