Ensure that all analytical results are accurate, traceable, recorded and reported in line with Laboratory Systems (LIMS);
Timeous reporting of analytical results and certificates of analysis;
Troubleshoot and assist in problems arising in the systems and any other laboratory instruments;
Perform routine safety and quality inspections;
Perform routine waste and chemicals inventory inspections.
ABOUT YOU:
